# Firebase config - never commit (RULES.md §5.4)
**/google-services.json

# Release signing (M7, docs/RELEASE.md) - never commit (RULES.md §5.4).
# android/debug.keystore is intentionally committed (deterministic debug
# signing, see android/app/build.gradle.kts); the *release* keystore and its
# credentials must never be.
android/key.properties
android/release.keystore
*.jks
